From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Say when the desktop refuses to show a 3D video in 3D
Origin: other, Sparky Stereo OS (ORDER 453)
Forwarded: no
Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code

Qt Multimedia's VideoOutput declares the video to the desktop before it attaches anything. When the declaration is refused it draws the ordinary picture and says why in stereoLayerFailure (qt6-multimedia +stereo3d15, patch 0046); Dragon shows that reason to the person in the window, with the sentence in the nine languages.
---
--- a/po/de/dragonplayer.po	2026-11-09 19:13:35.035811811 -0300
+++ b/po/de/dragonplayer.po	2026-11-09 19:13:43.978387066 -0300
@@ -869,3 +869,7 @@
 msgctxt "@info"
 msgid "This build of Dragon cannot write the 3D correction into a file. The correction stays with this video in Dragon."
 msgstr "Diese Version von Dragon kann die 3D-Korrektur nicht in eine Datei schreiben. Die Korrektur bleibt für dieses Video in Dragon gespeichert."
+
+msgctxt "@info %1 is the reason the desktop gave"
+msgid "This video is shown flat: the desktop refused to show it in 3D (%1)."
+msgstr "Dieses Video wird flach gezeigt: Der Desktop hat die Darstellung in 3D abgelehnt (%1)."
